{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20268SPDHHbOZs1794535862.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>外交部宣布，國家主席習近平將出席亞太經合組織第三十三次領導人非正式會議及相關活動。</p><p></p><p>發言人指，APEC領導人非正式會議下周三、四在深圳舉行，習近平將主持會議並發表講話。他亦會出席周二、三舉行的APEC工商領導人峰會開幕式，並作主旨演講。會議期間，他會為與會各經濟體領導人或代表舉行歡迎宴會，並同外國領導人舉行雙邊會晤。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T02:43:48.692008+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":159,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T01:43:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T02:47:44.577645+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T02:37:12.351819+00:00","content_hash":"4e990d0824a3bec260bc9e628b13ae833677ce0f8c8eda228707aa84c42c4fd8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-13T02:43:48.692008+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}